WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:11,940
Wen Chen, hold on

2
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:13,440
She is exhausted

3
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:18,830
I have already captured her soul. Qi Xuan, stop it.

4
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:35,140
Qi Xuan is helping me heal my wounds

5
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,700
Sorry, I misunderstood

6
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,960
It doesn't matter

7
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,410
not enough

8
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:43,890
I can add some more

9
00:00:43,890 --> 00:00:45,930
Do you dare to cut your soul again?

10
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:47,430
Just get out of here
